    "text": "E. Gouker wins female 1-12 division at 12th annual Run for the Ring 5K in Aurora on Aug. 1, 2026\nBy\nW. A. Eddy12th Annual Run for the Ring 5K Race - Run/Walk in Aurora, Colorado on Aug. 1, 2026 had E. Gouker take first in the female 1-12 age group, clocking 23:43.79 and placing 24th overall, according to the RunSignUp results.\nGouker was listed with a hometown of Denver, Colorado.",
